                    <h2 class="sub">                    Cardioid Condenser Microphone</h2>
                    <p>The Lauten LA-220 is a large-diaphragm, fixed cardioid, side-address microphone. It is manufactured in China. </p><p>Along with its siblings the LA-120, and the LA-320, it is part of the Lauten &#8220;Series Black&#8221; line launched in 2016. The line is aimed at budding engineers working in less-than-ideal acoustic spaces.</p><p>The LA-220 has independent 12 kHz high cut and 120Hz low cut filters, engaged with switches on the front of the microphone. </p><p>The microphone comes in a padded cardboard shipping box with a spider shock mount.<p>Permalink: <a href="//recordinghacks.com/microphones/Lauten/LA-220">Lauten Audio LA-220</a></p><p>The mic was released in 2017.</p>
